flowchart LR
  subgraph consumer[业务项目]
    direction TB
    ci[ci.yml<br/>推送与 PR]
    manual[security-audit.yml<br/>手动触发]
    sched[security-schedule.yml<br/>定时或手动]
  end
  subgraph kit[dev-ci-kit 可复用工作流]
    direction TB
    java[java.yml<br/>编译与测试]
    front[frontend.yml<br/>lint 与构建]
    osv[security.yml<br/>依赖漏洞扫描]
    ocr[ocr-review.yml<br/>PR 代码审查]
    audit[security-audit.yml<br/>源码安全审查]
  end
  subgraph runtime[执行工具与结果（含外部服务）]
    direction TB
    build[Maven / npm<br/>构建与测试报告]
    scan[OSV-Scanner<br/>依赖扫描结果]
    review[OpenCodeReview + DeepSeek<br/>PR 审查意见]
    agent[DeepSeek Harness + DeepSeek<br/>参考 Cloudflare 指引]
    report[Actions Artifact<br/>源码审查报告]
  end
  ci --> java & front & osv & ocr
  sched --> osv
  manual --> audit
  java & front --> build
  osv --> scan
  ocr --> review
  audit --> agent --> report
